<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n454" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγεν-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γενέσθαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unborn, uncreated</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				27c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>of no family, ignoble</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγαθός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				84
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				33
			</span></i>&lt;*&gt;<i><span class="en">
				5.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; of things, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ
				ἀγενεῖς στίχοι</span> Sch. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.568
			</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				336
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				St.Byz.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀνακτορεία</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>childless</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				2.10
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Harp.
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπαις</span> codd.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
